WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.246
Assalomu alaykum.

2
00:00:01.246 --> 00:00:05.131
Kondensatorning zaryadlanishi, idishdagi tuz miqdori,

3
00:00:05.131 --> 00:00:11.949
serverga kelayotgan so‘rovlar — bular birinchi tartibli chiziqli tenglama bilan tavsiflanadi.

4
00:00:11.949 --> 00:00:19.939
Bugun bunday tenglamani to‘rt qadamda yechadigan universal usulni — integrallovchi ko‘paytuvchini o‘rganamiz.

5
00:00:19.939 --> 00:00:25.070
Bu algoritm mustaqil ishning ikkinchi topshirig‘ida ham kerak bo‘ladi.

6
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:32.584
Tenglamani normal ko‘rinishda yozamiz: y shtrix plyus p dan x karra y teng q dan x.

7
00:00:32.584 --> 00:00:37.835
Mu teng e daraja p ning integrali bo‘lgan funksiyani olamiz.

8
00:00:37.835 --> 00:00:42.036
Uning ajoyib xossasi: mu shtrix teng p karra mu.

9
00:00:42.036 --> 00:00:50.876
Shuning uchun tenglamani mu ga ko‘paytirsak, chap tomon mu karra y ko‘paytmaning hosilasiga aylanadi.

10
00:00:50.876 --> 00:00:53.414
Qolgani — oddiy integrallash.

11
00:00:53.664 --> 00:00:58.062
Misol: y shtrix plyus ikki y teng e daraja x.

12
00:00:58.062 --> 00:01:05.490
Bu yerda p teng ikki, uning integrali ikki x, demak mu teng e daraja ikki x.

13
00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:08.520
Tenglamani mu ga ko‘paytiramiz.

14
00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:18.098
Chap tomon e daraja ikki x karra y ning hosilasi, o‘ng tomon esa e daraja ikki x karra e daraja x,

15
00:01:18.098 --> 00:01:20.150
ya’ni e daraja uch x.

16
00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:28.979
Ikkala tomonni integrallaymiz: e daraja ikki x karra y teng e daraja uch x ning uchdan biri plyus C.

17
00:01:28.979 --> 00:01:33.870
Diqqat: C ni aynan shu yerda qo‘shamiz, bo‘lishdan oldin.

18
00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.787
Keyin e daraja ikki x ga bo‘lamiz.

19
00:01:36.787 --> 00:01:42.878
y teng e daraja x ning uchdan biri plyus C karra e daraja minus ikki x.

20
00:01:43.128 --> 00:01:46.474
Javobning tuzilishiga e’tibor bering.

21
00:01:46.474 --> 00:01:52.352
Birinchi had — bir jinsli bo‘lmagan tenglamaning xususiy yechimi.

22
00:01:52.352 --> 00:01:57.236
Ikkinchi had — bir jinsli tenglamaning umumiy yechimi.

23
00:01:57.236 --> 00:02:05.285
Tekshiramiz: hosila e daraja x ning uchdan biri minus ikki C karra e daraja minus ikki x.

24
00:02:05.285 --> 00:02:10.982
Ikki y ni qo‘shsak, C li hadlar qisqaradi va e daraja x qoladi.

25
00:02:11.232 --> 00:02:15.494
Grafikda bir nechta integral chiziq ko‘rsatilgan.

26
00:02:15.494 --> 00:02:22.017
x o‘sgan sari ularning barchasi e daraja x ning uchdan biriga yaqinlashadi,

27
00:02:22.017 --> 00:02:26.279
chunki C karra e daraja minus ikki x tez so‘nadi.

28
00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:31.149
Bu yerda C karra e daraja minus ikki x — o‘tkinchi qism,

29
00:02:31.149 --> 00:02:38.629
e daraja x ning uchdan biri esa tashqi ta’sirga mos majburiy yoki asimptotik javobdir.

30
00:02:38.629 --> 00:02:46.718
U o‘suvchi funksiya bo‘lgani uchun uni qat’iy ma’noda o‘zgarmas barqaror holat deb atamaymiz.

31
00:02:46.968 --> 00:02:53.459
Tekshiruv savoli: ekrandagi tenglama uchun integrallovchi ko‘paytuvchini toping.

32
00:02:53.459 --> 00:02:58.814
Avval y shtrix oldidagi koeffitsiyent birga tengligini tekshiring.
